+# S11 centre-conditioned path implementation — 2026-10-11
+
+**Status:** local offline implementation verified; NOT adopted into runtime.
+**Base:** `8fea93f2cfa27c455114d0921bbeacb9f697ad13`.
+**Branch:** `work/s11-center-alternatives-20261011`; no commit/push/merge.
+**Authority:** current work plan remains unchanged; O2 OPEN / FIELD FAIL.
+
+## Implementation
+
+Implemented the attached 2026-10-10 program review's P1 in the existing material
+path owner. The new immutable records and explicit offline function retain each
+original seed/polarity's optimal path through each original central-sector row.
+The optimum is sector count then the original additive local score, not median
+quality, smallest Y, physical role or publication eligibility. Raw median-check
+failures remain visible. No old function body or production caller changed.
+
+The original source is an exact byte prefix and identical AST prefix of the
+candidate. Default generation is tested to never call the extension. This is
+not a new live O1 trace namespace, a resolver beam expansion or a release.
+
+## Frozen experiment and execution
+
+`scripts/s11_center_path_trial.py` freezes 23 conditions and 29 input hashes
+before extraction, then reconstructs the existing saved profile arrays exactly.
+The conditions comprise all 18 prior public water/beer/milk rasters/scales,
+water A/B at both established scales, and the source-qualified sample4/f1275
+native crop. These are 12 native source frames from four recordings, not 23
+independent videos or an untouched holdout. Source videos were not decoded.
+No sample3 or Windows pixels were executed or transferred.
+
+All 23 captures completed: 33,674 status records, including 12,477 locally
+admissible paths whose nodes, jumps, accumulated scores and lineage were checked.
+These counts are not true positives. All default candidate fields and 29 input
+pins were preserved. The 40 random small graphs cover 400 centre/polarity oracle
+comparisons. The final focused and owner-regression suite completed with 396 PASS,
+zero failures and zero skips, including 58 new tests in the centre-path file.
+The admission-guard replay produced exactly matching raw-capture hashes in all
+23 conditions. This is a repeatability check, not 23 additional independent cases.
+
+## Position representation outcomes
+
+The following are pooled central-sector sample positions after raw median
+checks, not measured contours, selected Oil/Foam heights or physical accuracy.
+Intervals are used only for readout, never extraction. Fractional source values
+are resize-grid mappings, not subpixel accuracy.
+
+| Condition | Existing retained compatible samples | New preserved compatible samples |
+|---|---|---|
+| B native | none | source rows 484–489 |
+| B height 200 | none | approximately 484.0, 488.1 |
+| C native | 490 | source rows 489–494; old 490 retained |
+| C height 200 | none | approximately 492.3 |
+| A native, Foam upper role | 476 | source rows 476–481 |
+| A height 200, Foam upper role | none | approximately 475.7, 479.8 |
+| Sample4/f1275 native | 836 | source rows 833–841; old 836 retained |
+
+A is not lower Oil truth. Its appearance-based Foam-support failure is not
+repaired by this path experiment. Sample4's selected Oil scalar is likewise not
+the central-sector row in this table. No public selected scalar changed.
+
+## Counter-evidence, resources and disposition
+
+Empty water/beer/milk vessels still retain respectively 245/301/265 distinct
+native central rows passing the raw median checks. These are geometric
+alternatives, not 811 reported false detections. Directly promoting this capture
+to Oil authority is rejected. The ideal inclined no-seed synthetic remains
+unrepaired; unknown inclined real contours were not relabelled from geometry.
+
+The first real run took 0.034–1.788 seconds per diagnostic call, 10.449 seconds
+across 23 calls. The largest output had 5,194 records. A separate allocation
+probe on that case measured 4,027,188 peak traced bytes (about 3.84 MiB), excluding
+preprocessing and serialization; this is not process RSS or a worst-case proof.
+The observed maximum live-state count across cases was 3,456. Instrumented timing
+was 10.329 seconds and must not be confused with ordinary capture timing.
+
+Use only offline/on-demand. Do not turn this on for every frame in live reports.
+P1's pre-selection compression question is locally answered; further parameter
+sweeps are not warranted. P2 must add actual comparable physical opposition on
+shared current support. Existing constellation/ordered-patch code should be
+reused, not presented as a newly discovered discriminator. O3 association, O4
+phase and Foam front authority remain separately gated. Report efficacy remains
+NOT TESTED; S11 stays ACTIVE and O2 OPEN / FIELD FAIL.
+
+Machine evidence is retained under `sample/output/s11-center-path-20261011-001/`
+and its admission-guard replay `sample/output/s11-center-path-20261011-002/`.
+The first runner is preserved before entry-point hardening; the second uses the
+shared source-admission guard and prevents overwriting completed evidence. No
+detector predicates, graph, score, budget, frame or reviewed interval changed.
+
+Reproduction uses the candidate checkout and the original checkout's retained
+assets; run `scripts/s11_center_path_trial.py prepare` and then `run`, supplying
+`--evidence-root` and a NEW `--out` directory. No source-video export is required.
+The machine [readout](../../50-diagnostics/s11/2026-10-11-center-path-trial.json)
+and [preflight](../../50-diagnostics/s11/2026-10-11-center-path-preflight.json)
+preserve per-case scopes and artifact hashes. Detailed gzip records stay local.
+
+## Detector Governance
+
+- Logic-map nodes: `OIL-CANDIDATE`, `TRACE-PUBLICATION`.
+- Failure-registry entries: `S11-F02`.
+- First harmful stage: original per-seed winner compression loses position-compatible raw alternatives before deduplication/top-k; this is not physical target identity or the cause of all missing outputs.
+- Logic-map impact: NONE — the new explicit offline API has no production consumer and all existing generator bodies and selected outputs remain unchanged.
+- Failure-registry impact: NONE — this diagnoses and repairs one representation facet of existing F02 without claiming a new field mechanism, classifier, or Windows repair.
